      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Have you personally tried both VR and Google cardboard?\n\nI found Google cardboard to be a good tech demo, something I tried out for maybe 20 mins in total. \n\nMeanwhile I bought an Oculus rift and used it enough over the last 8 years to wear out certain parts.",
